To shift from spot (a whole number) with marker (a whole number).
If marker is less than 0, set item 0 of starts to keystart, set item 0 of ends to keyend, return.
If item marker of ends is at most keyend, set item (spot plus 1) of starts to keystart, set item (spot plus 1) of ends to keyend, return.
